1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 20=

34
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:02,880
What are you doing?

35
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,840
That thousand-year-old fox spirit

36
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,640
really is powerful.

37
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,440
She almost...

38
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,280
almost...

39
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,360
charmed me.

40
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,360
Almost?

41
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,240
Almost.

42
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,400
Yes.

43
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,200
Yes.

44
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,120
I, Su Ling'er, greet the Ancestor.

45
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,920
Greetings, Ancestor.

46
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:29,720
But Ancestor,

47
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:30,720
why

48
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,240
do you look so young?

49
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:33,640
Beauty

50
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,720
runs in the fox clan.

51
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,200
The greater our spiritual power,

52
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:40,440
the more beautiful we become.

53
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,760
I could've

54
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,720
charmed every living soul,

55
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:49,600
but I've been trapped in Xuanyuan Tomb
for thousands of years.

56
00:02:50,750 --> 00:02:51,700
Luckily,

57
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,560
you didn't disappoint me.

58
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,560
Oh.

59
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,800
So you're the one

60
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,760
taking orders from this old fox.

61
00:02:59,120 --> 00:02:59,800
Oh?

62
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,480
Oh...

63
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:06,400
Monk,

64
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:11,040
why are you so worked up?

65
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,600
Everything

66
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,440
is destined.

67
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,440
If you're going to talk, just talk.

68
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,520
Why get so close?

69
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:22,960
Exactly!

70
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,900
Don't you know

71
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:25,800
you haven't bathed in 1,000 years?

72
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:26,440
You reek!

73
00:03:26,650 --> 00:03:27,560
You're making me sick!

74
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,080
Please!

75
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:32,600
You seriously stink.

76
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:33,720
Could you move over?

77
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,200
Why are you being so polite to her?

78
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:35,680
Back up!

79
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,440
Back up!

80
00:03:37,473 --> 00:03:38,980
Back up! Hurry!

81
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:39,800
Back up!

82
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,480
Come on!

83
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,720
Move farther away!

84
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,720
And you!

85
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,280
You're not only

86
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,400
a thief,

87
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,440
you're an idiot too.

88
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:49,360
Why would you trust her?

89
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,840
She's using you.

90
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,240
Once you're no use to her,

91
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,440
she'll gobble you

92
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,320
right up.

93
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:54,800
Exactly!

94
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:55,680
What an idiot.

95
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,360
Benefactor,

96
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,720
don't listen to him.

97
00:03:58,200 --> 00:03:59,040
Exactly.

98
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:00,800
Ling'er is right.

99
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:01,800
Benefactor,

100
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,720
you're not just Ling'er's benefactor.

101
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:06,040
You're our whole clan's benefactor.

102
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,640
From this day on,

103
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:08,680
the fox clan

104
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,320
will make you our king.

105
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:11,800
May our king

106
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,280
unite the Three Realms!

107
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:15,000
Unite the Three Realms?

108
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,120
We'll talk about that later.

109
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,200
I just want to see my wife.

110
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,640
My wife!

111
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,480
Your wife

112
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,800
is in Youming City.

113
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,440
All the souls in Youming City

114
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,600
are under the lord's control.

115
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,280
Only if

116
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:31,320
you absorb his spiritual power

117
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,600
can you bring your wife

118
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,320
back to the mortal world.

119
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:37,080
She's lying to you!

120
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:39,200
His power is second only to mine.

121
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:40,240
If you go there,

122
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,760
you won't come back alive!

123
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,720
Exactly!

124
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,040
You're such an idiot.

125
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,240
My Lord,

126
00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:46,680
you're a demon dragon now.

127
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,680
Within the Three Realms,

128
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,520
no one can defeat you.

129
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:53,320
Fine.

130
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:55,720
But I have one problem.

131
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:56,760
I...

132
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,600
look like this.

133
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:59,600
I'm afraid my wife will be scared of me.

134
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,840
Oh.

135
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:02,520
All right.

136
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:03,720
Transform!

137
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:07,720
Ah!

138
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,080
Huh?

139
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:12,200
What's this?

140
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,150
What kind of getup is this?

141
00:05:13,150 --> 00:05:14,360
What's with the white gloves?

142
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,520
Are you serving roast duck?

143
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:20,920
You...

144
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:22,120
Are you messing with me?

145
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:23,920
Forgive me, My Lord.

146
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:25,480
It was an emergency.

147
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:26,280
I only

148
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:27,920
had women's things on hand.

149
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:29,880
That's...

150
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,480
not the point!

151
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:33,920
Do I have to cover my face

152
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,440
every time I see my wife?

153
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:38,640
You've only just gained this power.

154
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,680
Your Qi hasn't stabilized yet.

155
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:40,920
If

156
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:43,400
you absorb the lord's spiritual power,

157
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,480
you'll look like yourself again.

158
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:47,840
Fine.

159
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,440
Kill the Lord of Youming City.

160
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:50,440
Save my wife.

161
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:52,960
No! Don't!

162
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:58,040
I'll go with my benefactor.

163
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,840
Oh, come on.

164
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:01,040
You old fox,

165
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,040
what exactly are you plotting?

166
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:03,680
Exactly!

167
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,760
What do you mean, what am I plotting?

168
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,600
Can't I have plans of my own?

169
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:15,720
That's true.

170
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,480
Yeah.

171
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:18,920
But

172
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:20,920
you were right about one thing.

173
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,280
Three-Headed Jiao is no match

174
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:26,000
for the Lord of Youming City.

175
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:26,960
Once

176
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:29,120
the lord wounds him,

177
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,200
I'll...

178
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:34,400
Wait...

179
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:36,360
You two

180
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,720
were trying to trick me into talking!

181
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:39,800
No.

182
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,440
The immortals of the Three Realms

183
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:43,600
joined forces to seal me here.

184
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,640
Just you wait.

185
00:06:46,100 --> 00:06:47,200
You'll see

186
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:49,080
my wrath destroy them all.

187
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:53,840
See you around!

188
00:06:54,729 --> 00:06:55,743
Ugh...

189
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:56,480
They're all gone.

190
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,840
There's no time to lose.

191
00:06:58,960 --> 00:06:59,320
Shouldn't we

192
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:00,300
hurry up and find

193
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:00,880
the Lord of Youming City?

194
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:01,600
Without my powers,

195
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,040
I can't get down there.

196
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:03,840
Then...

197
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,080
I'll go for you.

198
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:05,840
You can't.

199
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,840
You're not powerful enough.

200
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:07,760
If you go down there,

201
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:10,080
the yin energy will overwhelm you.

202
00:07:10,300 --> 00:07:11,200
Then what do we do?

203
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,200
I've got it!

204
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,200
Follow me.

205
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:14,800
Hey!

206
00:07:18,650 --> 00:07:19,577
(Youming City)

207
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,560
Why did you follow me?

208
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,320
Youming City is full of danger.

209
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:23,600
I was worried about you,

210
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:24,760
so I came along.

211
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:25,440
Fine.

212
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:26,240
Let's go.

213
00:07:29,130 --> 00:07:32,200
(Youming City)

214
00:07:34,440 --> 00:07:35,760
As long as you obey,

215
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:38,440
I guarantee you'll have a place

216
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,960
under her rule.

217
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,920
If she can get me out of here,

218
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,880
I'll do whatever she asks.

219
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,240
You wretched woman!

220
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,040
Is the food ready?

221
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,200
It's ready.

222
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,880
Then go do the laundry!

223
00:07:51,960 --> 00:07:52,640
What, are you waiting to eat?

224
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:53,680
Father,

225
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,240
she's asking for a beating.

226
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:57,000
A few more hits should teach her.

227
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:57,440
Don't!

228
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,600
I'll go right now.

229
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,800
- Hmph.
- Hmph.

230
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:13,600
Excuse me.

231
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,600
Have you seen my wife?

232
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:15,360
Wow!

233
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:16,120
What a handsome man!

234
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,720
Can I be your wife?

235
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:18,880
Whoa!

236
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:21,040
Benefactor,

237
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,360
we should go back.

238
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:23,900
I...

239
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:25,700
I haven't found my wife yet.

240
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,880
What I told you before

241
00:08:26,900 --> 00:08:28,480
about her using you was true.

242
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,200
I heard her say it myself.

243
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,040
No.

244
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:32,800
Didn't you say she was forced?

245
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:33,880
Well...

246
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,200
You were about to hang yourself.

247
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:35,960
I panicked,

248
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:37,040
so I said that.

249
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:39,040
She'd rather be with a city guard.

250
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:41,200
- A city guard?
- She wouldn't even come help you.

251
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:45,360
I was afraid it'd break your heart.

252
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:45,920
Impossible.

253
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,440
Oh...

254
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,120
Darling!

255
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,400
Darling!

256
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:12,440
Mother!

257
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:14,440
She's taking my things!

258
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,880
It was mine to begin with.

259
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:20,200
Who are they?

260
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,840
I'm sorry.

261
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:23,960
They...

262
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:27,280
are my children.

263
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,360
Children?

264
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,880
They're already this big?

265
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:39,200
You must've had them before we met.

266
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,200
Don't blame yourself.

267
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:44,040
What a cute child.

268
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:48,440
No.

269
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:51,840
They're...

270
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:52,960
the children I had with

271
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:55,040
a Youming City guard.

272
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:58,320
We've only

273
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,200
been apart a few days.

274
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:01,600
How can they already be this big?

275
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:02,360
You...

276
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,840
Youming City is unlike anywhere else.

277
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,080
Here, in one day,

278
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,640
a woman can conceive and give birth.

279
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:11,480
In seven days,

280
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:14,760
children can grow this big.

281
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,400
I told you!

282
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:16,920
Look!

283
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,240
Her kids are already this big.

284
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,400
Darling...

285
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:21,840
Darling?

286
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:23,720
What's wrong, darling?

287
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:24,680
It was her.

288
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:29,000
She and that rotten monk

289
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,400
were the ones who got me killed.

290
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:32,520
What?

291
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:33,520
That's a lie!

292
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,400
Darling,

293
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:37,720
she was in love with you,

294
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:39,200
so

295
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,720
she tried to kill me.

296
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,480
To survive,

297
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,800
I had to be with another man.

298
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,200
Darling...

299
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,600
You're lying!

300
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,320
I can't believe

301
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:53,600
it was you

302
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:54,400
who got my wife killed!

303
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:55,240
No wonder

304
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,840
you didn't want me to find her.

305
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:59,040
She must be miserable here.

306
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,600
That's why she's lying to you.

307
00:11:01,100 --> 00:11:02,040
Once she gets out

308
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,360
and sees how you look now,

309
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,360
she'll abandon you again.

310
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:09,440
I only look like this because...

311
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,040
Darling.

312
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,240
No matter what you look like,

313
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:20,400
you'll always be my husband.

314
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:22,240
Mm.

315
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:23,920
Darling...

316
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:25,600
Stop playing dumb!

317
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:30,120
I never knew you were so despicable.

318
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:33,320
You...

319
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,440
Look at her!

320
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:38,800
You shameless woman!

321
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,160
How dare you cheat right in front of me!

322
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:41,280
Darling!

323
00:11:41,900 --> 00:11:42,280
Darling!

324
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:50,120
Father! Father! Father!

325
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:53,040
Oh no!

326
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:54,440
The Lord of Youming City is coming!

327
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:55,280
Get away!

328
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:56,040
Darling,

329
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:57,000
I'm taking you out of here.

330
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:57,480
Let's go!

331
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:09,120
Hmph.

332
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,120
You hurt my men

333
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,160
and think you can run?

334
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:14,560
Darling!

335
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:15,360
Watch out!

336
00:12:15,520 --> 00:12:16,440
It's the Lord of Youming City.

337
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:17,520
He's incredibly powerful.

338
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:19,280
Don't be afraid, darling.

339
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,040
Once I absorb his spiritual power,

340
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:23,000
I'll look like myself again.

341
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:23,480
Oh!

342
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,200
I'm so scared!

343
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,200
A puny demon like you

344
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,560
wants to absorb my power?

345
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:39,990
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

346
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:43,250
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

347
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:47,050
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

348
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:50,080
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

349
00:12:50,540 --> 00:12:57,290
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

350
00:12:57,310 --> 00:13:00,840
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

351
00:13:07,550 --> 00:13:10,750
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

352
00:13:10,780 --> 00:13:14,010
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

353
00:13:14,300 --> 00:13:17,320
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

354
00:13:17,330 --> 00:13:19,010
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

355
00:13:19,050 --> 00:13:20,930
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

356
00:13:20,970 --> 00:13:22,490
♪I left my wife behind♪

357
00:13:22,630 --> 00:13:24,090
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

358
00:13:24,130 --> 00:13:27,910
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

359
00:13:27,970 --> 00:13:29,050
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

360
00:13:29,060 --> 00:13:31,150
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

361
00:13:31,190 --> 00:13:32,850
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

362
00:13:32,890 --> 00:13:34,720
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

363
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:38,080
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

364
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:41,350
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

365
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:44,480
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

366
00:13:44,500 --> 00:13:47,850
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

367
00:13:47,900 --> 00:13:51,510
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

368
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:54,860
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

369
00:13:54,900 --> 00:13:57,970
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

370
00:13:58,550 --> 00:14:01,600
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

371
00:14:01,620 --> 00:14:05,040
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

372
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:08,600
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

373
00:14:08,620 --> 00:14:12,080
♪You're just wasting your time♪

374
00:14:12,130 --> 00:14:15,050
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

375
00:14:15,100 --> 00:14:16,710
♪And I just laugh happily♪

376
00:14:16,740 --> 00:14:20,120
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

